OL,3,GNEWSAWest festivals confirm first acts
OL,4,Afor summer 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe may be experiencing some chilly
OL,7,Fmornings and not many hours of daylight
OL,8,Fright now but festivals across the West
OL,9,Fhave started releasing details of their
OL,10,Fheadliners for summer 2027.
OL,12,FForwards Festival revealed earlier that
OL,13,Felectronic duo Bicep will headline
OL,14,Ftheir event next year, with Bristol
OL,15,FSounds and Glastonbury announcing major
OL,16,Facts as well.
OL,18,FHere are some of the bands and solo
OL,19,Fartists coming to events in the West
OL,20,Fnext summer.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
